---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bubble Sort Seekho | DSA Apne Style Mein">
  <div class="space-y-16 py-6 sm:py-10">
    {/* Hero Section */}
    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText text-xs font-bold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider shadow-sm">
        <span>⚡ Class 11th & 12th Special</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Zero Prior Coding Needed</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Bubble Sort Seekho <br />
        <span class="text-accent font-handwritten text-5xl sm:text-7xl">Bina Kisi Stress Ke!</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-textSecondary text-base sm:text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Suno, DSA se darna bilkul band karo. Yahan koi boring computer definitions nahi hain — 
        sirf tiffin box, canteen line, aur tumhare favourite hobbies ke sath step-by-step seekhenge!
      </p>

      {/* Main CTA Button */}
      <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="/onboarding"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto btn-primary px-9 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg shadow-chalk flex items-center justify-center gap-2 tracking-wide"
        >
          <span>Shuru Karo</span>
          <span class="text-xl">🚀</span>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/visualizer-demo"
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-4 rounded-xl border border-textSecondary/30 bg-bg text-main hover:border-accent text-base font-semibold transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>Quick Demo Dekho</span>
          <span>👀</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-textSecondary font-medium">
        ⏱️ Pura course sirf 15-20 min mein complete ho jayega. No logins required!
      </p>
    </section>

    {/* Visual Card Preview Illustration */}
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="bg-card border border-textSecondary/20 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-textSecondary/15 pb-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-accent inline-block"></span>
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-accent2 inline-block"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary ml-2">bubble-sort-visualizer.preview</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono bg-focusBg text-focusText border border-focusBorder px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-bold">
            Pass 1: Comparing & Swapping
          </span>
        </div>

        {/* Mock Comparison Graphic */}
        <div class="flex items-end justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 py-6 border-b border-textSecondary/10">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary">Index [0]</span>
            <div class="bg-bg border border-textSecondary/30 p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-xl text-center font-bold text-sm w-20 sm:w-24">
              <div class="text-xl mb-1">🥟</div>
              <div>Samosa</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-mono text-accent">₹15</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="text-xl text-accent font-bold animate-pulse pb-6">
            ⇄
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent font-bold">Index [1]</span>
            <div class="bg-accent text-onAccent border border-accent p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-xl text-center font-bold text-sm w-20 sm:w-24 shadow-md scale-105">
              <div class="text-xl mb-1">🍕</div>
              <div>Pizza</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-mono">₹250</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary">Index [2]</span>
            <div class="bg-bg border border-textSecondary/30 p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-xl text-center font-bold text-sm w-20 sm:w-24 opacity-60">
              <div class="text-xl mb-1">☕</div>
              <div>Chai</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary">₹10</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Hinglish Callout Quote */}
        <div class="dhyan-do-box p-4 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium">
          <strong>Dhyan do! 💡</strong> Pehle do items compare honge. Agar pehla wala bada hai, toh simply jagah swap kar do. Phir repeat!
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Why Learn With Us Features Grid */}
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-center tracking-tight">
        Kyun yeh tarika sabse best hai? 🌟
      </h2>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <div class="bg-card border border-textSecondary/20 p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
          <div class="text-2xl">🍿</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-main">Personalized Analogies</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
            Cricket, Gaming, ya Food — jo tum select karoge, hum examples wahi se banayenge!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-card border border-textSecondary/20 p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
          <div class="text-2xl">🧼</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-main">No Hard CS Jargon</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
            Pehle aam Hinglish language mein samjhenge. Technical words ("Array", "Pass") sirf baad mein glossary popup ke sath aayenge.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-card border border-textSecondary/20 p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
          <div class="text-2xl">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-main">Interactive Visualizer</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
            Step-by-step play/pause karke dekho elements kaise sliding motion mein apni jagah pahunchte hain.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-card border border-textSecondary/20 p-5 rounded-2xl space-y-2">
          <div class="text-2xl">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-main">Zero Exam Pressure</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-textSecondary leading-relaxed">
            Koi marane wala marks system nahi hai. Wrong answer doge toh funny feedback milega, gussa nahi!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Bottom Call to Action */}
    <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center bg-card border border-textSecondary/20 p-8 rounded-3xl space-y-4 shadow-sm">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Tayyar Ho Seekhne Ke Liye?</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-textSecondary">
        Chalo apne favourite topics select karo aur bubble sort ko mast tariqe se samjho!
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="/onboarding"
          class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-base shadow-chalk"
        >
          <span>Shuru Karo</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
